WEBVTT

00:02.500 --> 00:06.202
Local AI connects EchoScribe to
services you run yourself.

00:06.977 --> 00:09.608
Configure an Ollama compatible
language model and a

00:09.660 --> 00:11.866
Whisper compatible transcription
endpoint,

00:11.994 --> 00:13.646
then test both connections.

00:14.136 --> 00:16.136
Processing happens on that computer.

00:16.703 --> 00:19.786
It is an experimental option for a
trusted local network

00:19.863 --> 00:21.024
or VPN.
